 <h3><u>Habib tum par salam e hussain</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Habib tum par salam e hussain..(4)<br> Chale aao karbobala..(2)<br> Akela hua hai hussain<br> Habib tum par salam e hussain..(2)<br> Mere habib, ay mere dost, ay meri aankho ke chayn<br> Habib tum par..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Rajab me madine se nikla tha mai<br> mohabbat thi jisse wo ghar chhod kar<br> mai sehta raha sakhtiya'n ay habib<br> rasool e khuda sheher chhod kar<br> chale aao karbobala...</p> 
  <p>2. Bohot mukhtasar sa hai lashkar mera<br> muqabil to mere hai laakho adu<br> wafadar bhi ho bahadur bhi ho<br> nazar dhundhti hai tumhe chaar su<br> chale aao karbobala...</p> 
  <p>3. Mere khoo'n ke pyase hai ye ehle sharr<br> mere qatl ki hai ye tayyariya'n<br> laeeno ki teghe bhi&nbsp; hai muntazir<br> tumhari zarurat hai mujhko yahan<br> chale aao karbobala...</p> 
  <p>4. Abhi mera maqtal saja bh nahi<br> magar mujhpe roti hai karbobala<br> meri bekasi ka hai jo marsiya<br> agar sunna chaho to ay hamnawa<br> chale aao karbobala...</p> 
  <p>5. Ye tehreer padhte hi nikle habib<br> to rahwaar roka sare karbala<br> kiya aake sheh ko salam e wafa<br> habib e hazi se ye sheh ne kaha<br> acha kiya habib tum yaha aagaye<br> mere habib, ay mere dost, ay meri ankho ke chayn</p> 
  <p>6. Ye dekho&nbsp; ye dekho sitam<br> kahan mere khaime kahan alqama<br> jo dil par hai guzri sunaunga mai<br> jo tum aa gaye to dilasa mila<br> acha kiya habib tum yaha aagaye</p> 
  <p>7. Ye mazhar, ye irfan, ye matami<br> hai tarteeb me karwaan e aza<br> ye sab hai habib e shahe mashraqain<br> sare hashr bolenge shahe huda<br> Habib tum par salam e hussain..(4)</p> 
